#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0029 expect=skipped domain=QS
#note "QS is a FINDINGS member, so ONLY the Exclude entry [IE, QS, SC, SS] rejects. PMDA-only facet (FDA twin has no excludes) - B-targeting discriminator. Row would fire if in scope (numeric result, unit-less)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset QS class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col QSTESTCD type=Char
col QSSTRESC type=Char
col QSSTRESU type=Char
col QSORRESU type=Char label="Original Units"
---
S1 | QS | 001 | ADAS01 | 3.5 | | mg/dL
